---
title:    "Call Pattern Analysis for Functional Logic Programs"
citation: "(PPDP 2008)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/PPDP08.html"
date:     2008-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
